{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d23bb727ea9425e628d2e84602958283d7b10199edc4cde63fbb039ccc91db33", "ja": "（新曲のPV撮影で、山の中へとやってきた。\n撮影場所まで、だいぶ山道が続くな……）", "zh": "（为了拍摄新歌的PV，我们来到了山里。\n到拍摄地点还要走很长一段山路啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "1ff2af5cb4b2344fe8a9237b8f26dd1c1da8614f40f901b923663e15e718695e", "ja": "おやぶん、早く早く！\nあんまり遅いと、たまき、おいてっちゃうぞ～！", "zh": "大叔，快点快点！\n再这么慢吞吞的，环可就要把你丢下啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e5f17116422d8b15290dc6913a4a0758426f46b466360f0c480956990d0af60f", "ja": "ぜーはー……ぜーはー……。\nた、環……ちょっと休憩しよう……。", "zh": "呼……呼……  \n小、小环……先休息一会儿吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "b2d008feed8d8885171ad3c269453ddca7a366fa4bfdd28c4e094485b042ad6b", "ja": "おやぶん、もう疲れちゃったの？", "zh": "老大，已经累了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1004_p", "source_sha256": "64b442d9615d3b882916682eabe953793c244af0af8c16f9a4f627ef5eb2d8ec", "ja": "ごめんな。少し休んだら大丈夫だから……。\n環は、まだまだ元気みたいだな。", "zh": "对不起啊。稍微休息一下就没事了……  \n环好像还精神得很嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "f3b1ec339b933436a0293f9cf8c1ff999d00a7343eb5a76ca272055c40386aa9", "ja": "うん！　だって夜いーっぱい寝たし、\n朝ごはんも、たっくさん食べてきたからね！", "zh": "嗯！因为我昨晚睡了个饱饱的觉，\n而且早餐也吃了好多好多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "8b14938f499f3f766e7fb332595ba5c8b22eba86cbaf8eda089e09e5699d6bd4", "ja": "それに、おやぶんといっしょに山に登るの、楽しい！\n探検してるみたいで、ワクワクするぞ～。", "zh": "而且，和老大一起爬山很开心！感觉就像在探险一样，让人兴奋不已～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9382831dd67ac50bed0f2a4a5b6d7585e5051747cba57c0a8f7d90b223593160", "ja": "ははっ、たしかに！　環の衣装と、\n自然いっぱいの景色で探検隊っぽくみえるかもな。", "zh": "哈哈，确实！环的服装再加上充满大自然的景色，看起来还真像探险队。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "36def8cf5c57eca5479f30c1031a429a9d5f8b6bb5930009e9f8be5c33f8e2ce", "ja": "それじゃ、今日の隊長は……あーっ！\nおやぶん隊員、変な虫を発見！", "zh": "那么，今天的队长是……啊——！老大队员，发现奇怪的虫子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3c95b04a9ce93244488ae254553936ad69b525000efc9d687546964068f3f28f", "ja": "えっ？　どこに……。", "zh": "诶？在哪里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "37e187845ae712334891ff962b9529a0acc4e7769d55e1d4d517e4612c2acf34", "ja": "あぁ～……飛んでっちゃった……。\n見たことない虫だったから、仲よくしたかったな。", "zh": "啊～……飞走了……。\n因为是从没见过的虫子，还想和它交朋友来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "a26531ec0afc97841e5529152817a0d057680c648bb7639836e7c8f11c1a91e7", "ja": "ねえ、おやぶん。この山すごいね！\n見たことない虫とか、変な鳴き声が聞こえる！", "zh": "喂，老大。这座山真厉害啊！\n还能听到没见过的虫子和奇怪的叫声！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7ffff653f49c385d35c88c9e67308d9ff58b5ac7be4513fdc89b6f504a4bf166", "ja": "へえ、そうなのか。\n香川のおばあさんの家にもいない虫がいるのか？", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。\n连香川奶奶家也有没见过的虫子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "e22ffdaba46d1dbc99025edbd6eeef32b2b174f74726b449926a241cc4272404", "ja": "うん！　ばあちゃんちの裏山でも\n見たことないぞ～。", "zh": "嗯！就连奶奶家后山我也没见过哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "de6e81fec6a0c48f7fd90f8fd65211a81a86f37350eb5ad09e09c32d1cd8990f", "ja": "たまき、小さいころばあちゃんちの裏山に\n秘密基地を作って、そこに宝物を隠してたんだ～。", "zh": "环境小时候在奶奶家后山上建过秘密基地，还把宝物藏在那里呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0749a4ffb1b03e7e12265824deac6809e647341b0d029350e3befd6dab30ac03", "ja": "おお、それはすごいな。\n環の探検好きは、その頃から変わってないんだな。", "zh": "哦，那可真厉害。环喜欢探险的劲头，从那时候起就没变啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "61204d23b5efc554c137aa1b1ff00a7cdee8d927cb4241c6cb6b1393c129328c", "ja": "うん！　だって探検って楽しいから！\nかっこいい棒とか、どんぐりとかいっぱい拾えるし。", "zh": "嗯！因为探险很有意思嘛！还能捡到好多帅气的棍子、橡果什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "8b50a810f8285de07ac610a4fbf56184bc1d6958127cc43b9f560337879b3b54", "ja": "セミの抜けがらとか……\nあとは、動物もいっぱいいるし！", "zh": "蝉蜕什么的……还有，这里也有好多动物！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e2619d7b33bdc7ea55f50f611d070f01c0a862bfaac661398ab1c725ca33e81f", "ja": "動物と友達になれるのは、楽しそうだな。\nそれと比べたら、劇場の探検はつまらなくないか？", "zh": "能和动物成为朋友，听起来很有意思。\n这么一比较，剧场探险不是很无聊吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "fc65961a65739e59d675e4eacf414261b78ce271f8c84b9587f17a6a36313898", "ja": "ううん、全然！　おやぶんがいるでしょ。\nそれにこぶんと、みんなもいるから楽しいよ！", "zh": "才不会，完全不会！不是还有老大在嘛。\n而且还有小弟和大家在，可开心啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1020_p", "source_sha256": "51bf1d810ca0ac9aeeef37c4668fb31882344890e85dac63011fabc6ca0863f5", "ja": "そうか。……よかったな、環。", "zh": "这样啊。……那就好，环。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "d64ccaaa39ca4d640eb1bf7f4296c1b9c87722ff74d1eddfbb7b5bc702985987", "ja": "？　どうしたの、おやぶん。\nもう平気？", "zh": "？怎么了，老大。\n已经没事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1022_p", "source_sha256": "19fb7c80f692b6bc6159f191ea30617e94d7e8dce06aace4768a530b5cc51d69", "ja": "ああ。もう大丈夫だ！\n休憩につきあってくれてありがとな。", "zh": "啊，已经没事了！\n谢谢你陪我休息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "fdb7b41666cbef191fcdd49c760ba61a6a34b6ad3d10e6854dbd2e6573c51fea", "ja": "くふふ、お安いご用だぞ。\nスタッフの人たちも待ってるし、早く行こう！", "zh": "嘻嘻，这点小事一桩啦。工作人员们也在等着呢，快走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0374_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "b80e661018584486d6a73dd57761b925d7166aaba6c39ecd58e0c6d0baf8e3f5", "ja": "ハイホー隊、出発進行～！！", "zh": "嗨吼队，出发咯～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
